<title>UK: Barratt shares fall, Kleinwort rates &quot;sell&quot;.</title>
<headline>Barratt shares fall, Kleinwort rates &quot;sell&quot;.</headline>
<dateline>LONDON 1997-01-23</dateline>
<text>
<p>Shares in Barratt Developments Plc fell on Thursday after analysts at Dresdner Kleinwort Benson trimmed their profit estimates for the stock and issued a &quot;sell&quot; recommendation, dealers said.</p>
<p>By 1228 GMT, Barratt shares were seven pence weaker at 278-1/2p on volume of 1.4 million.</p>
<p>Analysts at Kleinwort were not immediately available for comment but market sources said they had cut their profit forecasts following a meeting with the company.</p>
<p>-- Andrew Marshall, London newsroom +44 171 542 4367</p>
</text>
